  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Using LMVT in [0,2] $\\frac{f(2)-f(0)}{2-0}=f^{\\prime}(c),$ where $c \\in(0,2)$\r\n\r\n$\\frac{f(2)+3}{2} \\leq 5 \\Rightarrow f(2) \\leq 7$",
